Subject: [PATCH 08/18] ttf: read hhea's line gap

The reader took hhea's ascender and descender but not its line gap, so a
font whose hhea.lineGap was 25 compiled to 0, which changes the line spacing
CoreText and FreeType-based engines use.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
---
 babelfont/resources/ttf/StaticLegacy.ttf | Bin 1052 -> 1052 bytes
 babelfont/resources/ttf/make_fixtures.py |   5 +++--
 babelfont/src/convertors/ttf.rs          |  11 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

